# JWT Authentication API

Node.js + Express + MongoDB REST API with JWT access/refresh token rotation, httpOnly cookies, and role-based access control.

---

## Stack

Node.js (ESM) · Express 5 · Mongoose 9 · jsonwebtoken · bcrypt · dotenv · cookie-parser · Morgan

---

## Setup

```bash
# .env
JWT_SECRET=your_secret
MONGO_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/auth

npm install
npm run dev   # http://localhost:3000
```

---

## Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Role | Description |
|--------|----------|------|------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/auth/register` | — | — | Create account |
| POST | `/api/auth/login` | — | — | Login, get tokens |
| GET | `/api/auth/get-me` | Bearer | any | Current user info |
| POST | `/api/auth/refresh-token` | cookie | — | Rotate tokens |
| PATCH | `/api/auth/update-role` | Bearer | admin | Change a user's role |
| DELETE | `/api/dele/users/:id` | Bearer | admin | Delete a user |

---

## Token Strategy

| Token | Lifetime | Transport |
|-------|----------|-----------|
| Access | 15 min | Response body → `Authorization: Bearer` header |
| Refresh | 7 days | `httpOnly` cookie only |

Every `/refresh-token` call issues brand-new tokens and invalidates the previous refresh token in the database. A mismatch between the incoming cookie and the stored token returns `401` immediately — stolen/replayed tokens are rejected.

---

## Roles

| Role | Can do |
|------|--------|
| `user` | Protected routes |
| `manager` | Same as user (extendable) |
| `admin` | Everything + update roles + delete users |

All users register as `user`. The first admin must be set manually in MongoDB.

---

## Security

- Refresh token in `httpOnly` cookie — JS can't read it (XSS)
- `sameSite: strict` — no cross-origin cookie sends (CSRF)
- Short access token (15 min) limits leak window
- bcrypt password hashing
- Server-side role checks on every admin action
- Admin cannot delete their own account

---

## Quick Postman Reference

**Register** — `POST /api/auth/register`
```json
{ "username": "john", "email": "john@example.com", "password": "secret" }
```

**Login** — `POST /api/auth/login`
```json
{ "email": "john@example.com", "password": "secret" }
```
Returns `{ token, role }` + sets `refreshToken` cookie.

**Get Me** — `GET /api/auth/get-me` · `Authorization: Bearer <token>`

**Refresh** — `POST /api/auth/refresh-token` · cookie sent automatically

**Change role** — `PATCH /api/auth/update-role` · admin only
```json
{ "userId": "<id>", "role": "manager" }
```

**Delete user** — `DELETE /api/dele/users/:id` · admin only